---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <div class="simple-page">
    <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>

    <p>
      Orlisse Living participates in affiliate marketing programs, which means we may
      earn a commission when you purchase products through links on our site — at no
      additional cost to you.
    </p>

    <h2>How It Works</h2>
    <p>
      When you click an affiliate link on our site and make a purchase, the retailer
      pays us a small percentage of the sale. This does not affect the price you pay
      in any way.
    </p>

    <h2>Why We Use Affiliate Links</h2>
    <p>
      Affiliate commissions help fund our work — the research, testing, photography,
      and writing that goes into every article. It allows us to keep our content free
      and accessible to everyone.
    </p>

    <h2>No Influence on Editorial</h2>
    <p>
      Our recommendations are never influenced by affiliate relationships. We recommend
      products because we believe in them, not because of commission potential. Products
      that earn us commissions are never favored over those that don't.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
